Hi all  <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_e_biggrin.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":D" title="Very Happy"> <br><br>recent changes to the tcpuart android app have caused me issues with reliability with the gd77 as a hotspot on android (under windows its fine) so I looked at the video posted on youtube by Riku <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2OSyDwcrSuc" class="postlink">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2OSyDwcrSuc</a> and its dated Sep 16, 2019.<br><br>based on the date, the version of tcpuart would have been TCPUART_v1.2 <br><br>so, I uninstalled v1.2.2 and reinstalled v1.2<br><br>using the latest bluedv 1.0.121 app<br><br>it still took 2 or 3 attempts to get it running, however, once running, it appears to be stable, however, on my old samsung sm-j320fn (Samsung Galaxy J3 2016) its a bit ropy  <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_mrgreen.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":mrgreen:" title="Mr. Green"> , other, newer devices, work fine.<br><br>here's hoping this helps someone<div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=404&amp;sid=b2c774568d0788ec52136b7cb4e69bbf" class="postimage" alt="20200107_113047-1.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div>UPDATE v1.2.3 on a newer tablet works great first time <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_mrgreen.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":mrgreen:" title="Mr. Green"><br><br>I should also add that I am using the latest firmware 6 jan 2020<dl class="file"><dt><span class="imageset icon_topic_attach"></span> <a class="postlink" href="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=401&amp;sid=b2c774568d0788ec52136b7cb4e69bbf">TCPUART_v1.2_apkpure.com.zip</a></dt></dl><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=66">m1dyp</a> — Tue Jan 07, 2020 11:20 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
